---
// Botanical tree spine — desktop left (≥1024px) · mobile vine right (<1024px)
//
// BEHAVIOR
//   1. Trunk + branches SPROUT in one seamless CSS animation when hero scrolls away
//      (not tied to scroll position — it just grows, then it's done)
//   2. As the user scrolls the page, flowers + extra branches BLOOM in waves
//   3. By the page bottom: full tree with dense blossom cluster at base-left
//
// ACTIVE SECTION
//   The branch for the section closest to the viewport center enlarges:
//   stroke 2→4px, leaves scale 1→1.2. Deactivates when section leaves view.
---

<!-- ══ DESKTOP ══ -->
<nav class="tree-desktop" id="tree-spine" aria-label="Page navigation" style="opacity:0;">
